      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the info. it's a relief to hear that it's probably not a stroke if i don't have the limb weakness part. i actually feel a bit better now. i'm just really busy with work this week and dont really have time to sit in an urgent care for hours. do you think it's safe to just wait a day or two to see if it improves on its own? or maybe i could just try some vitamins or something to see if that helps first?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
